number = 1746
title = "[Coherence] The task record's rotation wiring requests and blocked status describe a disclosure binder and auth keeper that 22.31.496 already changed"
revision = "a910fdedd579e63379ae6c2e4d4971990d28f8ad"
verdict = "spec-edit"
evidence = "Task 22.33.63 is done at spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:200390 and requires 22.31.496 at spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:200393, but its record still requests binder and keeper admission at services/human/crates/layerx-human-service/tests/repair_22_33_63.kvx:47 and services/human/crates/layerx-human-service/tests/repair_22_33_63.kvx:48 despite commit 47e3f12fba6f8015d788bd5f63e0c6da1b296452 admitting the exact 92-byte 0x7102 field-count-4 payload at services/agent/crates/layerx-crypto/src/disclosure/call.rs:869 and modules/layerxauth/keeper/lifecycle.go:14; the specification must correct the done task's record, including its obsolete refusal claim at services/human/crates/layerx-human-service/tests/repair_22_33_63.kvx:69, to acknowledge that support and reassess the blocked findings against current evidence, distinguishing the custody-only assertions at services/human/crates/layerx-human-service/tests/support/repair_22_33_63_rotation.rs:194 from the separate unsupported rotation projection at services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/src/managed_agent_rotation.rs:60 and retired announcement/commit stages at services/human/crates/layerx-human-service/src/server/production_rotation.rs:240."
close_comment = "The rotation repair record needs correction: the disclosure binder and auth keeper already accept the compiler's 92-byte rotation payload, so the requests to add that support are obsolete. Reassess the two blocked findings using current evidence while preserving the distinction between custody signing and committed rotation recovery; the existing custody tests alone do not establish the latter."
